{"aliases":["BERT Reranking","Cross-Encoder","Cross-Encoder Reranking","Neural Reranking","交叉编码器重排序"],"external_ids":{"arxiv":"1901.04085"},"history":[{"agent":"claude-code","at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.162193+00:00","fields":["id","how","why","kind","name","slug","what","layer","props","status","name_zh","summary","created_at","importance","tracked_at","expanded_at","merged_into","occurred_at","created_by_run"],"intent":"seed: BM25, RRF, cross-encoder reranking, LangGraph","op":"insert","reason":"resolve 无候选","run_id":"r_20261108_xy6xwx"}],"node":{"created_at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.162193+00:00","created_by_run":"r_20261108_xy6xwx","expanded_at":null,"how":null,"id":"n_01m6x5q6wkya5pawc6","importance":4,"kind":"method","layer":"knowledge","merged_into":null,"name":"Cross-Encoder Reranking","name_zh":"交叉编码器重排序","occurred_at":null,"props":{},"reviewed_at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.205496+00:00","slug":"cross-encoder-reranking","status":"active","summary":"用把查询与候选一起输入的交叉编码器，对初检结果重新精细打分排序。","tracked_at":null,"updated_at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.162193+00:00","updated_by_run":"r_20261108_xy6xwx","what":"检索第一阶段取回候选后，第二阶段把查询与每个候选拼接成一个输入，由 Transformer 联合编码并输出相关性分数，按分数重排。","why":"第一阶段检索要对整个语料库快速打分，只能用查询与文档互不交互的表示。让查询和文档在注意力里逐词交互能判断更细的相关性，但每对都要跑一次大模型，所以只用于少量候选。"},"relations":[{"confidence":0.9,"created_at":"2026-11-08T08:52:08.162193+00:00","dir":"out","id":"e_01m6x5q708t9kwcrbt","other_id":"n_01m6x5q6wkc4mwmggs","other_kind":"method","other_layer":"knowledge","other_name":"BM25","other_name_zh":"BM25 检索","other_occurred_at":null,"other_slug":"bm25","other_summary":"基于词频、逆文档频率和文档长度归一化的经典稀疏词项检索打分函数。","rationale":"该论文的流程里先用 BM25 取回上千候选，再由 BERT 交叉编码器重排，并在 MS MARCO 上大幅超过 BM25。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Passage Re-ranking with BERT (PDF)","url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1901.04085"}],"type":"related_to","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null}],"sources":[{"field":null,"published_at":"2019-01-13","publisher":"arXiv","quote":null,"title":"Passage Re-ranking with BERT","url":"https://arxiv.org